        "text": "iii.",
        "result": "\\((1+x)^{\\frac{1}{x}},\\quad\\frac{\\sqrt{x+a}-\\sqrt{a}}{x},\\quad\\frac{a^x-1}{x},\\quad\\frac{(1+x)^n-1}{x}\\text{ and }\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\text{ when }x\\to0\\)",
