        "text": "H. Steinhaus was polish mathematician and educator. He earned his ph.D degree from his mutable contribution to functional analysis through the banach-steinhaus theorem. He is also one of the early founders of probability and game theory. He also proposed sandwich theorem in 1938 first time specifically n = 3 case of bisecting 3-solids with a plane."
