        "text": "Verify result \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac1{\\frac{dx}{dy}}\\) for the following problems: (a) \\(f(x)=(4x-3)^3\\); (b) \\(f(x)=\\sqrt{15x^2+1}\\)."
