        "type": "command",
        "text": null,
        "result": "\\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac1{\\frac{dx}{dy}}=\\frac1{\\frac1{12(4x-3)^2}}=(1)\\left(\\frac{12(4x-3)^2}1\\right)=12(4x-3)^2\\)",
