        "type": "command",
        "text": null,
        "result": "\\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac1{\\frac{dx}{dy}}=\\frac1{\\frac1{\\frac{15x}{\\sqrt{15x^2+1}}}}=(1)\\left(\\frac{15x}{\\sqrt{15x^2+1}}\\right)=\\frac{15x}{\\sqrt{15x^2+1}}\\)",
