        "result": "\\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy}{dt}\\frac{dt}{dx}=\\frac{dy}{dt}\\frac1{\\frac{dx}{dt}}=\\frac{\\frac{dy}{dt}}{\\frac{dx}{dt}}=\\frac{g'(t)}{f'(t)}\\)",
