        "result": "\\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{-4x}{\\sqrt{\\frac{(x^2+1)^2-(x^2-1)^2}{(x^2+1)^2}}(x^2+1)^2}=\\frac{-4x}{\\sqrt{\\frac{4x^2}{(x^2+1)^2}}(x^2+1)^2}=\\frac{-4x}{2x(x^2+1)}\\)",
