        "text": "The printed cancellation uses √(4x²) = 2x, valid only for x > 0. In general √(4x²) = 2|x|, so the original principal-arccos function has derivative \\(\\frac{-2x}{|x|(x^2+1)}\\) for x ≠ 0: −2/(x²+1) on x > 0 and +2/(x²+1) on x < 0."
