        "text": null,
        "result": "\\(f^{(5)}(x)=\\frac{9!}{(9-5)!}6^5(6x+4)^{9-5}=\\frac{6^5\\,9!}{4!}(6x+4)^4=6^5(9)(8)(7)(6)(5)(6x+4)^4=6^5[15120(6x+4)^4]\\)",
