        "text": "Find the domain of (a) \\(F⃗(t)=2tî-3tĵ+t^{-1}k̂\\); (b) \\(F⃗(t)=\\sin t\\,î+(1-t)^{-1}ĵ+\\ln t\\,k̂\\)."
