        "result": "\\(\\left[\\frac{x^3}3+x\\right]_0^2=-\\left[\\frac{x^3}3+x\\right]_2^0\\Rightarrow\\frac83+2=-[0-(\\frac83+2)]\\Rightarrow\\frac{14}3=\\frac{14}3\\)",
